{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "5ce6e645adfbab6b9876d80e7278229460b93cfb4ea9bb0790694f46748fb6b1", "ja": "凶悪な犯罪者達のみが収監されている\n『ミリニアムシティ監獄』。元刑事の\n＜スタークス＞は、同僚＜アンジー＞殺害\nという、無実の罪で収監されていた。ある日\nスタークスは、面会へと連行される。", "zh": "这里只收押穷凶极恶罪犯的\n《米利尼亚姆城市监狱》。前刑警\n斯塔克斯因被诬陷杀害同事安吉，\n而遭到收监。一天，斯塔克斯被带去会面。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_01_1002_003mik", "source_sha256": "335d34212e3b9b09a490114cb6170e6da94df50aeea3bd512fa0dd6cef21d14a", "ja": "待ってくれ……！　頼む、\nそっちには行くな……！", "zh": "等一下……！求求你，\n千万别去那边……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_01_1003_003mik", "source_sha256": "4bbad53081bb5be3086aa201d140818038f839a5a80d73da170d9d0095ce164e", "ja": "『アンジー』……！", "zh": "“安琪”……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_01_1004_se", "source_sha256": "ed2a3c67151ebff489879826ce3971d3bee9999ee4f15baa095aad91d6c9d088", "ja": "ガバッ", "zh": "猛地坐起身", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_01_1005_015siz", "source_sha256": "571e89a923149673d4305c99eeb32c2d88677ea751659cc5060813e566203c39", "ja": "おや。おはようございます、スタークス刑事。\n今日も貴方に、導きの光があらんことを。", "zh": "哎呀，早上好，斯塔克斯警官。  \n愿指引之光今日也照耀着您。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_01_1006_003mik", "source_sha256": "d431e351ef1e421c63bcdc85d44d633902fc787b0833ff228b197874376d58bd", "ja": "……。\n最悪の目覚めだ。", "zh": "……。\n真是糟透的起床感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_01_1007_015siz", "source_sha256": "06d8d8e40aed62fee836b248c555844a57580f65b371e562bb40df81f19666a2", "ja": "そうでしょうね、\n随分とうなされていましたから。", "zh": "确实如此，因为你刚才一直在说梦话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_01_1008_003mik", "source_sha256": "c1e9ce5d02bb77189037a29c406ae1b4752f9f1c3be4f57d378235c41b04ab7e", "ja": "……。\n俺は、寝言で何か言っていたか……？", "zh": "……。\n我……梦话里有说什么吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_01_1009_015siz", "source_sha256": "f3d9e18df642e733fb55923424f97e8eb54764a3d7c2aabbdb7dc25b21d51570", "ja": "いいえ、特には。", "zh": "没有，没说什么特别的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_01_1010_003mik", "source_sha256": "5d593aaf85be0a7d2f8db6da9564550476693d585bed5be01d1fd1e67370de68", "ja": "そうか。……はぁ。", "zh": "这样啊。……唉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_01_1011_015siz", "source_sha256": "1008c229bc3f91fb150e250af01fdd38b1908801a74c3109bd9c17d78034525f", "ja": "貴方、本当に顔色が悪いですよ。\n気分が悪いなら、看守を呼びましょうか？", "zh": "您的脸色真的很差。要是不舒服，要不要我叫看守过来？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_01_1012_015siz", "source_sha256": "b064df0bfe85317e6a3f286297209f0fce95f1b9c4852f6b7b251be2ade58c52", "ja": "それとも……\n私がひとつ、祈って差し上げましょうか？", "zh": "还是说……\n\n要不要我为你祈祷一次？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_01_1013_003mik", "source_sha256": "292be29354f2ddd6cf3b0c62a04dbcd29b307f15afbdd2b81acce4f966347d14", "ja": "結構だ。悪名高いモーガン様の祈りなんざ、\n後になっていくら請求されるかわかったもんじゃない。", "zh": "不用了。给声名狼藉的摩根大人祈祷，之后还不知道会被索要多少钱呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_01_1014_015siz", "source_sha256": "d5121d62f606f5cd56a72105fa9cdd2faf416527756bf49925875ae08e1e7f49", "ja": "ふふ、そうですね。\nただより高いものはありませんから。", "zh": "呵呵，说得对。\n没有什么比免费的东西更昂贵了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_01_1016_003mik", "source_sha256": "95dbc71b18aaac5ea7d1c8ede22df84cad02f606f02db8121848bdfbad7d1a9b", "ja": "（ここはミリニアムシティ監獄。俺の名はスタークス。\n刑事だが、無実の罪を着せられ、この監獄に送られた）", "zh": "（这里是米利尼亚姆市监狱。我的名字叫斯塔克斯。\n虽然是刑警，却被栽赃成了罪犯，送进了这座监狱）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_01_1017_003mik", "source_sha256": "34a96effda49f86cc70665ac7085a91d2ea111bfc2fd6e948207397a54df91a4", "ja": "（この独房にいるのは、世間を騒がせた\n一級品の凶悪犯罪者ばかり……）", "zh": "（关在这间单人牢房里的，全都是些曾轰动世间的\n一流穷凶极恶的罪犯……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_01_1018_003mik", "source_sha256": "2ce4e1ef21860be85d803f40cc126d9dabd813b94dbe129d47b4c9a04f661dcd", "ja": "（新興宗教団体『S』の教祖、モーガン。偽薬を\n万能薬と謳って信者に高額で売りつけた、ペテン師）", "zh": "（新兴宗教团体“S”的教主摩根。这个骗子把假药吹嘘成包治百病的万能药，高价卖给信徒）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_01_1019_003mik", "source_sha256": "73e78b4f444c061bcc646fe8c20a1900f3c08933c8f06b7e74630428751c041b", "ja": "（マフィア『ナターリ一家』のボス、イーサン。強烈な\nカリスマ性の持ち主で、外見年齢を操れるとの噂だ）", "zh": "（黑帮“纳塔利家族”的老大伊桑。据说他极具个人魅力，还能操控自己的外表年龄）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_01_1020_003mik", "source_sha256": "158ad6584078b0d75a411195d64f0522fca8929fff71bf8defcf37d791fb55f5", "ja": "（そして連続殺人犯のゼノビアは、所謂快楽殺人者。\n人を殺すのが楽しくてたまらないらしい）", "zh": "（还有连环杀人犯泽诺比亚，据说是所谓的快感杀人者。\n似乎觉得杀人快乐得不得了）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_01_1021_003mik", "source_sha256": "b23226260618dd5ae789d56c8ce28c2d6a50e6317a483198be03404e33c4c4fc", "ja": "はあ……とんだ連中に囲まれたもんだな。", "zh": "唉……真是被一群不得了的家伙包围了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_01_1022_015siz", "source_sha256": "8de9b4c6d70537aefed7053f7bd050703d7f4f733fb13d94f806af22f6d38573", "ja": "そして貴方は、元刑事の同僚殺し。\n同じ穴のムジナってわけですけど。", "zh": "而你，是杀害同事的前刑警。这样一来，也算是同一丘之貉了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_01_1023_003mik", "source_sha256": "4415deac0add57af25c84fa92c58f41644b7ce11eeb89c3b02441024111ea3d9", "ja": "違う！　俺は、お前らとは違う。\nあいつを殺してなんかいない！", "zh": "不对！我和你们不一样。\n我没有杀那家伙！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_01_1024_015siz", "source_sha256": "ee80e823d71e255e0f18dd48296bef0b10b8c077a94abe4acf1a607cc14ac30e", "ja": "そういえば、濡れ衣だと主張してましたっけ。ですが、\nここに収監される者の刑期は、最低でも100万年……", "zh": "说起来，您刚才是主张自己被冤枉了来着。不过，被关进这里的人的刑期，最低也是100万年……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_01_1025_015siz", "source_sha256": "afb11ad00e1973ad6050304f48b38a61fbf5b0d6c1d099db454a44c35a7de69d", "ja": "人間である限り、この監獄からは死ぬまで……\nいえ、死んでも出られるはずがありませんね。", "zh": "只要还是人类，就不可能在死前离开这座监狱……不，就算死了，也不可能出去吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_01_1027_se", "source_sha256": "fcbe34e9a319b880d975e94771dbd21aabf2488e0f47ab2f67a6eb9644efd187", "ja": "カツ、カツ、カツ……", "zh": "嗒、嗒、嗒……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_01_1028_keimukan", "source_sha256": "b776f7b2cf70f9842b4f7d05de980ccffed24a91f6e0cbb27d2a3c2c8733582d", "ja": "囚人番号76503、出ろ！　面会だ。\n拘束具の装着が済み次第、連行する。", "zh": "囚人编号76503，出来！有人探视。\n戴好拘束具后，立即押送。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_01_1029_003mik", "source_sha256": "bc3b418e56c8b66249cf3c781f5b3aebaa9e18164e889c2810362407f16cef93", "ja": "面会だって？　ここにいるのは、第一級の犯罪者だろ？\n面会なんてあるはずが……。", "zh": "探视？这里关着的不是一级重罪犯吗？怎么可能有人来探视……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_01_1030_keimukan", "source_sha256": "e8400c7bfe4320ebc4e29c19695ab4e93f5e1983d82ab256528d977fa1de2b55", "ja": "さっさとしろ！", "zh": "快点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_01_1032_keimukan", "source_sha256": "e2de6e186a0365269694a4b96126a9bce1ce821e53c31491bc52eb744b3c8f36", "ja": "失礼します！\n囚人番号76503、連れて参りました！", "zh": "打扰了！\n囚犯编号76503，已经带到了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_01_1033_034ayu", "source_sha256": "4ca4b091732bb62a08634c1d190df280d0a3f49da7f57ca8387789f3f59f053a", "ja": "ご苦労。", "zh": "辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_01_1034_003mik", "source_sha256": "1ac68dbe1c89a32b4e32ebf6550a14165f06cf10e7020acf78853cb92f7625d0", "ja": "えっ？\n……お、お前は……！？", "zh": "咦？\n……你、你是……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
